1
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:07,170
The radiance of the night shines through my window

2
00:00:07,170 --> 00:00:11,120
but the path to immortality is long.

3
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:15,850
The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.

4
00:00:15,850 --> 00:00:21,010
Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.

5
00:00:22,280 --> 00:00:25,000
Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,

6
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:28,250
I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.

7
00:00:28,250 --> 00:00:33,520
The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?

8
00:00:34,720 --> 00:00:37,480
I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness

9
00:00:37,840 --> 00:00:40,480
as the storm rages just below.

10
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:44,850
I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.

11
00:00:44,850 --> 00:00:47,840
I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals

12
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:50,690
why the world is a-changing.

13
00:00:50,710 --> 00:00:54,040
Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.

14
00:00:54,280 --> 00:00:57,210
Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,

15
00:00:57,210 --> 00:01:00,290
experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.

16
00:01:00,450 --> 00:01:03,170
I will defy the light in the sky

17
00:01:03,170 --> 00:01:06,610
to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.

18
00:01:15,690 --> 00:01:19,050
Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.

19
00:01:19,210 --> 00:01:22,130
Transform your insignificant body into light.

20
00:01:22,290 --> 00:01:25,250
The hardships of the journey

21
00:01:25,370 --> 00:01:28,210
will temper this young man's heart.

22
00:01:28,210 --> 00:01:32,850
If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?

23
00:01:39,600 --> 00:01:43,480
Renegade Immortal
Subtitles by Bonobosubs
https://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA

24
00:02:03,080 --> 00:02:07,040
I've been waiting for you.

25
00:02:05,640 --> 00:02:08,480
Ye Wuyou
First generation Suzaku

26
00:02:08,760 --> 00:02:10,480
Ye Wuyou ?

27
00:02:12,000 --> 00:02:13,560
What does Senior mean ?

28
00:02:15,240 --> 00:02:17,400
Throughout generations, the successive Suzakus

29
00:02:17,840 --> 00:02:21,080
were always appointed by the previous Suzaku.

30
00:02:21,520 --> 00:02:23,400
The only way to inherit the legacy

31
00:02:23,400 --> 00:02:25,400
is to obtain the Suzaku Seal

32
00:02:25,400 --> 00:02:27,960
and seize control of the Cultivation Planet Crystal.

33
00:02:29,560 --> 00:02:32,760
But if someone attempts to destroy the crystal,

34
00:02:33,320 --> 00:02:36,120
then it will choose its own master

35
00:02:36,840 --> 00:02:38,480
and make him the Suzaku.

36
00:02:39,240 --> 00:02:40,200
And you

37
00:02:40,480 --> 00:02:44,440
were chosen by the Cultivation Planet Crystal.

38
00:02:51,920 --> 00:02:54,760
Why does he have the aura of the Suzaku Seal ?

39
00:03:13,520 --> 00:03:14,280
That's...

40
00:03:14,480 --> 00:03:16,000
the Suzaku's inheritance !

41
00:03:16,760 --> 00:03:17,440
Impossible...

42
00:03:17,960 --> 00:03:18,800
Impossible !

43
00:03:19,200 --> 00:03:20,800
Without Zhuque Zi's approval,

44
00:03:20,880 --> 00:03:23,080
how could he obtain the Suzaku's inheritance ?

45
00:03:26,520 --> 00:03:28,720
Throughout 14 generations of Suzakus,

46
00:03:29,040 --> 00:03:32,200
this is the first time the crystal has been destroyed.

47
00:03:33,600 --> 00:03:35,040
So choosing him now

48
00:03:35,160 --> 00:03:36,640
makes a lot of sense.

49
00:03:37,240 --> 00:03:40,240
Are you willing to become the titled Suzaku ?

50
00:03:40,640 --> 00:03:42,880
Will you be planet Suzaku's guardian

51
00:03:42,920 --> 00:03:45,000
until the end of your lifespan ?

52
00:03:46,200 --> 00:03:47,200
I'm not willing.

53
00:03:53,640 --> 00:03:55,360
If you become the Suzaku,

54
00:03:55,840 --> 00:03:58,400
you will be the supreme ruler of planet Suzaku

55
00:03:58,440 --> 00:04:00,520
and worshipped by everyone.

56
00:04:01,280 --> 00:04:02,920
The Heavenly Jade Sect
The Earth Soul Sect
The Immortal's Path Sect

57
00:04:02,920 --> 00:04:05,000
pays respect to the Suzaku.

58
00:04:05,520 --> 00:04:07,200
As Suzaku,

59
00:04:07,520 --> 00:04:10,120
countless treasures will be yours.

60
00:04:10,720 --> 00:04:14,400
There will be no obstacles in your cultivation.

61
00:04:15,200 --> 00:04:16,800
If you leave now,

62
00:04:17,040 --> 00:04:19,240
you will face countless dangers.

63
00:04:19,520 --> 00:04:22,800
One misstep can lead to certain death.

64
00:04:23,920 --> 00:04:26,800
If you stay and accept the Suzaku Seal,

65
00:04:27,240 --> 00:04:28,560
you will rule the planet

66
00:04:29,120 --> 00:04:30,920
and live a carefree life.

67
00:04:31,320 --> 00:04:33,160
Why would you refuse ?

68
00:04:33,960 --> 00:04:35,120
My path

69
00:04:36,680 --> 00:04:39,600
won't stop at just planet Suzaku.

70
00:05:21,480 --> 00:05:22,600
Very well.

71
00:05:23,120 --> 00:05:24,360
To each their own,

72
00:05:24,920 --> 00:05:26,160
I can't force you.

73
00:05:26,280 --> 00:05:27,040
Senior,

74
00:05:27,280 --> 00:05:29,120
how do I retrieve my soul strand ?

75
00:05:29,320 --> 00:05:32,280
There are only two methods.

76
00:05:32,520 --> 00:05:35,960
The first is to kill the spirit that holds your soul strand.

77
00:05:36,120 --> 00:05:38,600
But finding your soul strand

78
00:05:38,600 --> 00:05:40,600
among all those spirits

79
00:05:40,640 --> 00:05:42,040
is unlikely

80
00:05:42,040 --> 00:05:43,560
and cannot be forced.

81
00:05:44,200 --> 00:05:45,560
The second method

82
00:05:45,600 --> 00:05:46,720
is to trade

83
00:05:47,200 --> 00:05:49,640
a life for a life.

84
00:05:51,160 --> 00:05:52,280
You can go.

85
00:05:57,960 --> 00:06:00,960
He actually rejected the Suzaku's inheritance ?

86
00:06:01,600 --> 00:06:04,320
A life for a life ?

87
00:06:05,320 --> 00:06:07,760
These two are my mortal enemies,

88
00:06:08,160 --> 00:06:11,320
they're perfect to exchange for my soul strand.

89
00:06:12,080 --> 00:06:15,560
But direct disciples of the Suzaku will be hard to kill.

90
00:06:15,960 --> 00:06:17,880
I should make a distraction first

91
00:06:18,360 --> 00:06:20,080
to weaken them.

92
00:06:20,520 --> 00:06:22,760
The Cultivation Planet Crystal doesn't have a master.

93
00:06:22,760 --> 00:06:23,880
Whoever obtains it

94
00:06:24,560 --> 00:06:27,640
will rule planet Suzaku.

95
00:06:28,800 --> 00:06:29,640
The Cultivation Planet Crystal !?

96
00:06:29,640 --> 00:06:30,680
Rule planet Suzaku !?

97
00:06:30,680 --> 00:06:31,960
This is a tremendous opportunity !

98
00:06:31,960 --> 00:06:32,600
It's mine !

99
00:06:33,720 --> 00:06:34,840
It must be mine !

100
00:06:34,840 --> 00:06:36,280
Don't you dare compete with me !

101
00:06:37,320 --> 00:06:38,760
Suzaku Formation,

102
00:06:38,960 --> 00:06:39,840
activate !

103
00:06:40,160 --> 00:06:41,720
The Cultivation Planet Crystal

104
00:06:41,960 --> 00:06:43,480
belongs to me !

105
00:06:43,560 --> 00:06:44,800
Give it to me !

106
00:07:10,240 --> 00:07:11,600
Is he being possessed ?

107
00:07:18,840 --> 00:07:20,360
Zhuque Zi...

108
00:07:20,800 --> 00:07:22,040
Junior Brother,

109
00:07:22,360 --> 00:07:26,720
this game was getting interesting

110
00:07:27,120 --> 00:07:30,760
so I borrowed Qian Feng's lifespan to come here

111
00:07:30,880 --> 00:07:34,320
and properly reunite with you.

112
00:07:35,000 --> 00:07:36,880
Did you think that

113
00:07:37,120 --> 00:07:41,520
I would give up planet Suzaku so easily ?

114
00:07:42,120 --> 00:07:44,720
You possessed and consumed your disciple's lifespan

115
00:07:45,000 --> 00:07:46,920
in order to replenish your own.

116
00:07:47,240 --> 00:07:49,520
Senior Brother's methods are impressive.

117
00:07:51,200 --> 00:07:52,000
Zhuque Zi !

118
00:07:52,400 --> 00:07:53,160
This is bad !

119
00:07:53,320 --> 00:07:54,160
Retreat !

120
00:07:56,520 --> 00:07:59,160
This doll is made from celestial iron.

121
00:07:59,520 --> 00:08:01,960
When you're in danger, activate its mechanism

122
00:08:02,320 --> 00:08:04,800
and it will save your life.

123
00:08:05,440 --> 00:08:07,640
If I had used it during a battle,

124
00:08:07,840 --> 00:08:09,080
it would have killed me

125
00:08:09,320 --> 00:08:10,720
before I killed anyone !

126
00:08:12,560 --> 00:08:14,280
The time has come

127
00:08:14,800 --> 00:08:16,400
to retrieve my soul strand.

128
00:08:16,960 --> 00:08:19,280
That doll is made of celestial iron

129
00:08:19,280 --> 00:08:21,400
and required centuries to refine.

130
00:08:23,120 --> 00:08:24,160
Could it be that...

131
00:08:24,400 --> 00:08:26,200
Zhuque Zi nurtured me from childhood

132
00:08:26,440 --> 00:08:28,320
just to steal my body !?

133
00:08:28,640 --> 00:08:30,440
That old bastard !

134
00:08:32,800 --> 00:08:34,400
You're dead !

135
00:08:52,440 --> 00:08:53,640
Transform !

136
00:08:59,680 --> 00:09:02,160
The direct disciple of the Suzaku

137
00:09:02,760 --> 00:09:04,160
is really hard to kill.

138
00:09:23,080 --> 00:09:23,880
Seal !

139
00:09:27,400 --> 00:09:28,240
Ceng Niu !

140
00:09:28,400 --> 00:09:30,320
Why are you trying to kill me !?

141
00:09:30,320 --> 00:09:31,640
I'm killing you

142
00:09:31,960 --> 00:09:33,360
for my own sake

143
00:09:33,800 --> 00:09:35,680
and because I promised Red Butterfly.

144
00:09:40,120 --> 00:09:41,960
This is the end for you,

145
00:09:42,320 --> 00:09:43,800
accept your death.

146
00:09:46,800 --> 00:09:48,600
Have you forgotten

147
00:09:49,440 --> 00:09:51,600
the Ancient God Blood Sword ?

148
00:09:53,520 --> 00:09:55,960
Ancient God Blood Sword

149
00:10:03,080 --> 00:10:04,040
This is...

150
00:10:06,960 --> 00:10:08,320
Ancient God blood ?

151
00:10:08,480 --> 00:10:10,640
My Qian Family's ancestors once said...

152
00:10:10,960 --> 00:10:13,800
that this sword can only be unsheathed if the family is in danger.

153
00:10:13,840 --> 00:10:14,760
Ceng Niu...

154
00:10:15,120 --> 00:10:16,480
Since it has come to this,

155
00:10:16,760 --> 00:10:18,360
you can rest in peace now !

156
00:10:19,040 --> 00:10:20,280
Die !

157
00:10:20,280 --> 00:10:21,840
The blood on this sword

158
00:10:21,840 --> 00:10:23,960
is the true blood of a 9-star Ancient God !

159
00:10:24,800 --> 00:10:27,000
How could Qian Feng have this as his last resort ?

160
00:10:27,560 --> 00:10:28,640
Killing him

161
00:10:28,880 --> 00:10:30,400
will not be easy.

162
00:10:43,400 --> 00:10:44,160
Tuo Sen !

163
00:10:44,360 --> 00:10:45,520
What is this monster ?

164
00:10:45,760 --> 00:10:46,760
Die !

165
00:10:49,840 --> 00:10:52,170
So the puppet was just a decoy

166
00:10:52,360 --> 00:10:54,560
and his Divine Sense was in the monkey.

167
00:10:57,960 --> 00:11:01,080
I didn’t want to resort to using this method

168
00:11:01,160 --> 00:11:04,880
because it will slightly damage my Divine Sense.

169
00:11:05,520 --> 00:11:07,320
But that puppet

170
00:11:07,320 --> 00:11:09,200
was utterly worthless.

171
00:11:09,400 --> 00:11:12,480
But now, with a drop of Ancient God blood,

172
00:11:13,640 --> 00:11:16,880
the Cultivation Planet Crystal is mine !

173
00:11:17,080 --> 00:11:18,520
After thousands of years...

174
00:11:18,800 --> 00:11:19,920
I will

175
00:11:20,320 --> 00:11:23,480
finally break free !

176
00:11:30,520 --> 00:11:32,440
Little brat,

177
00:11:32,640 --> 00:11:34,600
wait until I obtain the Cultivation Planet Crystal

178
00:11:34,920 --> 00:11:37,600
and then I'll come to deal with you.

179
00:11:46,600 --> 00:11:48,280
If Tuo Sen is back,

180
00:11:49,040 --> 00:11:50,560
then I can’t stay here.

181
00:11:54,280 --> 00:11:56,040
I use Qian Feng’s life

182
00:11:56,280 --> 00:11:58,520
to reclaim my soul strand !

183
00:11:59,480 --> 00:12:00,200
Red

184
00:12:00,200 --> 00:12:01,000
Butterfly...

185
00:12:14,720 --> 00:12:15,520
Trade !

186
00:12:33,480 --> 00:12:35,440
Qian Feng, oh Qian Feng...

187
00:12:35,720 --> 00:12:37,800
When you used me as your cultivation furnace

188
00:12:38,520 --> 00:12:40,360
did you ever imagine this day ?

189
00:12:44,520 --> 00:12:45,240
Reverse !

190
00:12:54,360 --> 00:12:55,240
Brother Wang...

191
00:12:55,920 --> 00:12:59,120
Senior Yunque taught her the furnace reversal technique.

192
00:12:59,760 --> 00:13:01,360
By killing Qian Feng,

193
00:13:01,840 --> 00:13:03,320
you gave Zi Xin

194
00:13:03,880 --> 00:13:06,040
his Soul Transformation cultivation.

195
00:13:13,240 --> 00:13:15,600
The Suzaku Tomb's collapse is so bad that

196
00:13:15,920 --> 00:13:18,400
even Situ Nan’s teleportation jade slip is struggling to activate.

197
00:13:39,240 --> 00:13:40,320
Wang Lin...

198
00:13:41,240 --> 00:13:43,440
Now it’s your turn.

199
00:13:58,920 --> 00:14:00,720
You do have some skill.

200
00:14:01,560 --> 00:14:04,360
It's no wonder that a mere Core Formation brat

201
00:14:04,560 --> 00:14:07,320
was able to obtain the memory inheritance.

202
00:14:08,240 --> 00:14:09,040
Merge !

203
00:14:10,320 --> 00:14:11,720
It's a pity that

204
00:14:12,200 --> 00:14:14,080
you can’t stop me.

205
00:14:40,760 --> 00:14:43,160
Come back here.

206
00:14:58,320 --> 00:14:59,360
Come out !

207
00:15:11,120 --> 00:15:12,000
Explode !

208
00:15:29,360 --> 00:15:29,840
What

209
00:15:29,840 --> 00:15:30,840
is happening ?

210
00:15:36,720 --> 00:15:38,320
If I make it out alive,

211
00:15:39,560 --> 00:15:41,800
I need to refill the Soul Flag.

212
00:15:50,040 --> 00:15:53,240
Even Zhuque Zi and I weren't able to stop him.

213
00:15:53,840 --> 00:15:56,840
But Wang Lin somehow killed him alone.

214
00:15:57,120 --> 00:15:58,560
The Cultivation Planet Crystal...

215
00:15:58,720 --> 00:16:00,360
Where is the Cultivation Planet Crystal !?

216
00:16:00,360 --> 00:16:03,360
To think that you could do this...

217
00:16:03,920 --> 00:16:05,240
Wang Lin...

218
00:16:05,560 --> 00:16:07,960
I really underestimated you.

219
00:16:13,560 --> 00:16:16,880
The self-detonation of all the souls in the Billion-Soul Flag

220
00:16:16,880 --> 00:16:19,440
wasn't enough to destroy a sliver of his Divine Sense.

221
00:16:34,080 --> 00:16:35,920
Die !

222
00:16:39,440 --> 00:16:41,640
I don't think that the Heaven Defying Bead

223
00:16:41,760 --> 00:16:43,680
can even help me escape from Tuo Sen.

224
00:16:44,440 --> 00:16:45,440
Seal.

225
00:16:53,000 --> 00:16:54,520
This farce

226
00:16:54,800 --> 00:16:57,200
ends here.

227
00:16:57,880 --> 00:16:59,560
Who are you ?

228
00:17:06,840 --> 00:17:08,920
It doesn't even matter who you are.

229
00:17:09,320 --> 00:17:10,840
Once I break free,

230
00:17:11,360 --> 00:17:13,360
I will kill you !

231
00:17:44,560 --> 00:17:45,440
You...

232
00:17:45,440 --> 00:17:46,640
You are...

233
00:17:47,720 --> 00:17:49,040
Zhuque Zi,

234
00:17:49,680 --> 00:17:51,800
will you admit your mistake ?

235
00:17:52,840 --> 00:17:54,160
Junior was wrong.

236
00:17:54,520 --> 00:17:56,560
I beg Lord Envoy for forgiveness.

237
00:17:57,040 --> 00:17:58,520
Envoy ?

238
00:17:58,960 --> 00:18:01,120
The Envoy of the Cultivation Alliance !

239
00:18:01,560 --> 00:18:02,800
Zhuque Zi,

240
00:18:03,080 --> 00:18:05,840
you dared to destroy the Cultivation Planet Crystal

241
00:18:06,240 --> 00:18:08,120
which is unforgivable.

242
00:18:09,080 --> 00:18:11,040
But given the circumstances,

243
00:18:11,400 --> 00:18:13,880
the Cultivation Alliance will let it slide.

244
00:18:14,240 --> 00:18:16,880
You can leave now.

245
00:18:30,080 --> 00:18:31,120
Junior Brother...

246
00:18:32,600 --> 00:18:34,080
In the end,

247
00:18:34,800 --> 00:18:36,160
you still

248
00:18:36,560 --> 00:18:38,720
weren't able to defeat me.

249
00:18:38,840 --> 00:18:40,160
I...

250
00:18:47,680 --> 00:18:48,880
Senior Brother...

251
00:18:49,560 --> 00:18:51,320
None of us won.

252
00:18:52,520 --> 00:18:55,440
We both lost miserably.

253
00:18:59,960 --> 00:19:01,080
This person

254
00:19:01,920 --> 00:19:03,720
feels strangely familiar.

255
00:19:06,600 --> 00:19:07,440
So...

256
00:19:07,720 --> 00:19:09,160
Does Brother Ceng Niu

257
00:19:09,360 --> 00:19:11,080
not recognize me ?

258
00:19:13,000 --> 00:19:14,480
It's you !

259
00:19:18,050 --> 00:21:54,250
Even if it looks like the Billion-Soul Flag exploded here, it didn't. Wang Lin even mentions the need to refill it later.
What happened in the novel is that Wang Lin took out all of the souls inside the flag to make them self destruct in hope of killing Tuo Sen's Divine Sense but he was also fighting with Zi Xin at the same time with a few primary souls. Those souls survived and returned to the Billion-Soul Flag after the fight.

260
00:19:35,210 --> 00:19:38,510
To let go of the consequences of my actions

261
00:19:38,510 --> 00:19:40,230
is to ignore the law of cause and effect

262
00:19:40,270 --> 00:19:42,170
like scattered ink.

263
00:19:43,050 --> 00:19:49,650
As destiny falls

264
00:19:45,890 --> 00:19:49,650
in exchange for this moment of tainted dreams.

265
00:19:49,650 --> 00:19:57,250
It makes the mountains lose their colors,

266
00:19:52,890 --> 00:19:57,250
wither and melt into rivers.

267
00:19:57,690 --> 00:20:04,810
Who can deceive

268
00:20:00,450 --> 00:20:04,810
the law of the heavens ?

269
00:20:05,130 --> 00:20:08,130
Countless generations

270
00:20:06,410 --> 00:20:08,130
have tried before me.

271
00:20:08,420 --> 00:20:11,850
But how could I not catch my dreams

272
00:20:10,250 --> 00:20:11,850
within my warm fingers ?

273
00:20:12,410 --> 00:20:15,930
You're at my side when I'm alone

274
00:20:15,930 --> 00:20:19,250
giving me the strength to fight the will of the heavens.

275
00:20:20,010 --> 00:20:23,210
Fortunately, my mind was open and honest.

276
00:20:23,570 --> 00:20:27,410
I'm sorry we never got to see the fireworks

277
00:20:25,410 --> 00:20:27,410
in the streets.

278
00:20:27,570 --> 00:20:32,370
Can I break the vortex of our destiny ?

279
00:20:29,130 --> 00:20:32,370
Can I break the rules ?

280
00:20:32,380 --> 00:20:35,090
To run towards you !

281
00:20:35,130 --> 00:20:38,410
I will fight the law of the heavens and the law of cause and effect

282
00:20:38,410 --> 00:20:43,050
to cut down this tribulation with my own hands

283
00:20:43,050 --> 00:20:46,450
and break through the reincarnation cycle.

284
00:20:46,490 --> 00:20:51,130
All of that for the stars in your eyes.

285
00:20:51,580 --> 00:20:56,810
I wish to bend this dream for the fire in my heart.

286
00:20:56,930 --> 00:21:00,730
If your soul is willing to wander,

287
00:21:00,730 --> 00:21:05,370
can I still take your hands

288
00:21:02,410 --> 00:21:05,370
and hold them tight ?

289
00:21:05,530 --> 00:21:08,450
I will defy the heavens and prevent the stars from falling.

290
00:21:08,450 --> 00:21:13,330
I will overthrow the Immortals and the Demons in my heart.

291
00:21:13,340 --> 00:21:16,610
I dream of destroying

292
00:21:16,770 --> 00:21:21,330
the shackles of our fate.

293
00:21:21,330 --> 00:21:25,290
You're the only one that can ignore the law of cause and effect.

294
00:21:25,290 --> 00:21:28,090
You're the hardest to let go of.

295
00:21:28,170 --> 00:21:31,970
I want to be with you again

296
00:21:32,050 --> 00:21:35,330
so I can look in your eyes.

297
00:21:35,610 --> 00:21:40,570
Even for a moment, it's worth it.
